#: src/onboarding.py:446
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Kotala matériel mpe bisaleli ya TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami. Kotia <i>tpm2-tools</i> na "
"ndenge ya automatique..."

#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel TPM 2.0 ezali kosala. Mot de passe na yo "
"ekokangama malamu na kati ya TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami, kasi botiami ya automatique "
"ya <i>tpm2-tools</i> elongi te. Tambwisa <code>sudo apt installation tpm2-"
"tools</code>. Kozonga sima na caching ya ba credentiels basé na logiciel."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami te. Kosalela caching ya ba "
"credentiels oyo esalemi na logiciel (AES-256-GCM)."

