#: src/main.glade:423 src/onboarding.glade:111
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Clé / KWallet Déverrouillage automatique"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Activer authentification ya elongi mpo na ko débloquer automatiquement clé "
"ya bokɔti na yo to KWallet na bokɔti. Yango ebombaka malamu mot de passe na "
"yo ekangami na TPM soki ezali, to e chiffré na AES-256-GCM na kosalelaka "
"fungola ya masta ya misisa kaka. Face auth etie PAM_AUTHTOK pona "
"pam_gnome_keyring to pam_kwallet5 selon bureau na yo."

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Ezalela ya lelo:"

#: src/main.glade:486
