#: src/onboarding.glade:63
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup esalemi!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:82
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Tosilisi! Ubuntu Hello ezali sikoyo activé na ordinateur oyo. Meká kosala "
"eloko nyonso oyo olingaki normalement kokoma mot de passe na yo mpo na ko "
"authentiquer, lokola kosala commande na sudo. Soki o activer auto-"
"déverrouillage ya ba clés, clé ya login to KWallet na yo eko déverrouiller "
"pe automatiquement na login.\n"
"\n"
"Okoki kofungola Configurateur Ubuntu Hello sima mpo na kobongola ba "
"paramètres ya likolo to kobakisa ba modèles ya kobakisa. Finá Silisa na nse "
"mpo na kokanga lininisa oyo mpe kofungola Configurateur Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.glade:130
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement clé ya bokɔti na yo to "
"KWallet na kosalelaka authentification ya elongi, kopekisa ba prompts ya mot "
"de passe sima ya kokota."

#: src/onboarding.glade:142
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Activer clé automatique/KWallet déverrouillage"

#: src/onboarding.glade:184
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Confirmer mot de passe"

#: src/onboarding.glade:216
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Kobongisa politiki ya bondimi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:235
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Na ntina na mbongwana ya ba angles, distance, mpe makambo mosusu match match "
"ya elongi ezalaka jamais exactement ndenge moko na modèle ya elongi oyo "
"ebombami. Na page oyo okoki ko setting ndenge nini Ubuntu Hello esengeli "
"ezala strict."

#: src/onboarding.glade:274
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Noki"

#: src/onboarding.glade:290
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \n"
"but speeds up the scanning process greatly."
msgstr ""
"Epesi nzela na ba matchs flou mingi, . \n"
"kasi esalaka ete mosala ya scanner esalaka nokinoki mpenza."

#: src/onboarding.glade:329
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Ezali na bokatikati"

#: src/onboarding.glade:345
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \n"
"but might not log you in when further away."
msgstr ""
"Encore détection relativement noki, . \n"
"kasi ekoki kozala ete okɔta na site te ntango ozali mosika."

#: src/onboarding.glade:384
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Libateli"

#: src/onboarding.glade:400
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \n"
"but will take much longer to authenticate you"
msgstr ""
"Option oyo ezali mwa libateli, . \n"
"kasi ekozwa ntango molai mingi mpo na kondimisa yo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:443
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Kobakisa modèle ya elongi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:462
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to "
"recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Pona ko authentiquer yo Ubuntu Hello esengeli o sauver modèle ya elongi na "
"yo po a reconnaître yo. Finá butɔ Scan oyo ezali awa na nse mpo na kobanda "
"kosala scanner ya elongi."

#: src/onboarding.glade:564 src/onboarding.glade:655
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Kobongisa webcam"

#: src/onboarding.glade:581
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Est-ce que émetteur infrarouge ezali ko clignoter ?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:599
msgid "yes"
msgstr "Iyo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:616
msgid "no"
msgstr "Te"

#: src/onboarding.glade:674
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoluka na système na yo automatiquement ba caméras nionso oyo "
"ezali, yango wana sala que webcam na yo ezala connecté. Sima ya détection "
"liste ya ba webcams oyo ekoki kosalelama ekolakisama. Poná oyo olingi "
"kosalela mpe finá na Suivant."

#: src/onboarding.glade:697
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Komeka ba webcams na yo, svp zela..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:749
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Kozwa ba fichiers ya ba données"

#: src/onboarding.glade:768
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello esengeli na ba ensembles de données misato ya reconnaissance "
"facial pré formée po ezala na makoki ya koyeba yo, oyo eko télécharger "
"sikoyo. Okoki komona ndenge oyo téléchargement ezali kokende na nse."

#: src/onboarding.glade:789
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Kobanda kozwa téléchargement..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:838
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Boyei malamu na Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:854
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Ya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:875
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Assistant oyo ekotambola na yo na processus ya configuration pe eko "
"configurer automatiquement Ubuntu Hello pona yo. Finá pembeni mpo na kokoba."

#: src/onboarding.glade:899
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Kolongola"

#: src/onboarding.glade:919
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Oyo elandi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:944
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Silisa setup"

